{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he eats the berry... savoring its flavor then says \"its quite good, thank you\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T11:35:58.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867731699915030558","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she smiles. 'No, thank you. When I came out of the water earlier, I felt like... myself, and not that I was just an inhabitant of my own corpse. I cannot thank you enough for the second chance.'","created_at":"2021-07-22T11:37:10.973000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867732002065088522","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"He shrugs and says \"should anyone be defined by their greatest mistake?  Should we not allow people a chance for redemption?\"  He pauses a moment to chew a bit more.  \"Imagine.... dedicating your life to a concept or ideal... and failing to follow it for 1 day.... should you spend eternity reliving that 1 day?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T11:40:19.983000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867732794830094336","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Everyone has bad days sometimes. It's just a part of life... not that I'm the most qualified to talk about it, but then if even I can pick that up, why can't others?'","created_at":"2021-07-22T11:41:37.146000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867733118475698196","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he nods \"that is why I give people second chances.... because we cant be defined by our failures.... and need to be allowed to redeem ourselves....\" a sadness shows in his eyes, or possibly tiredness","created_at":"2021-07-22T11:43:08.864000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867733503168479243","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...are you alright? After, ah, yesterday's events, have you gotten any rest?'","created_at":"2021-07-22T11:43:38.559000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867733627717681153","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
